{"parentUuid":"4f4c6342-b088-4819-844e-50c8911c4abe","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_012rBWowz52bKrTqZwNLEvMo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Linear MCP tools let you interact with Linear (project management) directly from here. Here's what's available:\n\n**Issues**\n- `list_issues` — search/filter issues\n- `get_issue` — get details on a specific issue\n- `save_issue` — create or update an issue\n- `get_issue_status` / `list_issue_statuses` — check workflow states\n\n**Projects & Milestones**\n- `list_projects` / `get_project` / `save_project`\n- `list_milestones` / `get_milestone` / `save_milestone`\n\n**Labels**\n- `list_issue_labels` / `create_issue_label` / `list_project_labels`\n\n**Documents**\n- `list_documents` / `get_document` / `create_document` / `update_document`\n- `search_documentation` — search docs by query\n\n**Comments**\n- `list_comments` / `save_comment` / `delete_comment`\n\n**Organization**\n- `list_teams` / `get_team`\n- `list_users` / `get_user`\n- `list_cycles`\n\n**Other**\n- `create_attachment` / `get_attachment` / `delete_attachment`\n- `extract_images`\n\n**Example usage** — just ask me things like:\n- \"List all my open issues\"\n- \"Create a new issue titled 'Fix login bug' on team X\"\n- \"What's the status of issue ABC-123?\"\n- \"Search Linear docs for authentication\"\n- \"Show me all projects\"\n\nWant me to try something specific? For instance, I can list your teams or issues to get started."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10439,"cache_read_input_tokens":7525,"output_tokens":442,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10439,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CZQ1hSbNt5APG39yFrLSB","type":"assistant","uuid":"4759