{"parentUuid":"8b131595-8028-4fb8-b972-ac159d51683f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01YVhKFqu2bpQeJih73NhLYn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\nYes, exactly. The workflow would be:\n\n1. **You create issues in Linear** (via the app, as you normally do)\n2. **I pull them here** — e.g., \"get me issue ABC-123\" or \"list my open issues\"\n3. **I read the issue details** — title, description, acceptance criteria, etc.\n4. **I go fix it** — make the code changes right here in your codebase\n5. **I update the issue** — mark it done, add a comment with what I changed\n\nSo you can say things like:\n- \"Pull issue ABC-123 and fix it\"\n- \"What are my open bugs? Pick one and fix it\"\n- \"Grab the top priority issue and work on it\"\n\nWant to try it? I can list your teams/issues and we can go from there."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":466,"cache_read_input_tokens":17964,"output_tokens":194,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":466,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CZQ2jcWMpJBCbEyNgGNXC","type":"assistant","uuid":"0d5fd7c2-9455-4cc7-9497-ca32180ea47f","timestamp":"2026-03-25T15:25:10.500Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gold/VS code/claude/chess UI","sessionId":"7d232acb-2ec9-4c6d-b832-8e8fc1a77d7c","version":"2.1.83","gitBranch":"main"}
